  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 420 * 42 * 10 * 2 * 102\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) =, +, ×, ÷ \n\nGiven: 420 * 42 * 10 * 2 * 102\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 420 = 42 + 10 × __**2 **____**÷ 102**__\n\n⇒ 420 = 42 + __**10 × 0.02**__\n\n⇒ 420 = __**42 + 0.2**__\n\n⇒ 420 ≠ 42.2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) ÷, ×, +, =**\n\nGiven: 420 * 42 * 10 * 2 * 102\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**420 ÷**____** 42**__ × 10 + 2 = 102\n\n⇒ __**10 × 10**__ + 2 = 102\n\n⇒ __100 + 2__ = 102\n\n**⇒ 102 = 102**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷, +, =, ×\n\nGiven: 420 * 42 * 10 * 2 * 102\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**420 ÷**____** 42**__ + 10 = __**2 **____**× 102**__\n\n⇒ __**10 + 10**__ = 104\n\n⇒ 20 ≠ 104\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ×, ÷, =, +\n\nGiven: 420 * 42 * 10 * 2 * 102\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 420 × __**42 ÷ 10**__ = __**2 + 102**__\n\n⇒ __**420 × 4.2**__ = 104\n\n⇒ 100 ≠ 104\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
